+// Package vcfnetworks onboards vCenter data sources into VCF Operations for
+// Networks 9.1 in a way that is safe to repeat: the mutating
+// addVcenterDatasource call is issued only after the target has been shown to be
+// absent, so a retried onboarding converges instead of duplicating.
 package vcfnetworks
 
 import (
